    comment "en" """
        Source V7948 = Swedish extension of ICD-10 V79.4 (Driver of bus injured in collision with
        unspecified motor vehicles in traffic accident) with activity suffix SNOMED CT 127349007 (other
        specified activities). Target SNOMED CT 435988 (concept_code 127349007) =, standard concept,
        Observation/Event domain. Athena ICD10CM crosswalk for V79.40 maps to 433930 (Motor vehicle on
        road in collision with another motor vehicle) and 435988; 435988 is selected as it captures the
        driver-role axis that distinguishes V79.4 within the bus-occupant block. Mapping is broader:
        target fully subsumes the transport-injury axis but drops the bus-specificity and the Swedish
        activity qualifier (orthogonal context dimension not represented in SNOMED CT injury concepts).
        Confidence (low) per rubric: Swedish national extension with activity dimension lost, crosswalk
        sourced from ICD10CM base code rather than Swedish code directly, and the bus-collision context
        is generalized to.
        """
}
